Node ID=1 Conversation Start Demon
Text=So, Scion of Lionheart, you managed to escape those vicious assassins. Not bad, but I've seen better from lesser mortals - certainly King Richard would have fared better. You have a *staggering* amount to learn before you'll be ready to face those enemies again, let alone survive in this hostile world for long.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
