Node ID=1 Fight Skills Explanation
Text=The most direct and least subtle of the disciplines, fighting skills allow you to increase your prowess in battle. Within this discipline, you can increase your proficiency with missile and melee weapons, learn to fight unarmed, and learn to evade the blows of your enemies.
