Node ID=8 bastard child
Text=Yes, but I doubt the throne of England will soon feel the heavy weight of your flaccid buttocks. You see, Richard traveled far and wide in the world and under my tutelage quickly learned how to have a...very good time. He left a trail of bastard children whose bloodline has steadily diluted and diminished until it could produce nothing better than you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 lionheart
Text=During the time of the Disjunction, much of the world was thrown into a delicious state of chaos. Many died - it was glorious! In the midst of the carnage, I noticed great strength within King Richard and I joined with him. Ever since, I have slept in your bloodline, Richard's bloodline, waiting for one of your pitiful wretches to surprise - or at least amuse - me.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Do you mean I am the descendant of a king?
Go to node ID=8 bastard child

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions.
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Thank you, spirit. Let's continue on.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 hunted
Text=It pains me to admit this, but I don't know. Sloth, it's one of my favorite vices - I've been sleeping a long time in your bloodline, so I'm about as groggy as you are dull-witted. Perhaps we should seek some answers and help from those within Barcelona.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=1 Exit Skill Tutorial
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 demon spirit
Text=I am the fly in the ointment, the mote in the eye, and the hereditary headache that has troubled your hapless family line for centuries, much is my pity. I do hope that you will be providing more entertainment than the last few wretched acorns to fall from your family tree.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=15 union
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 union
Text=You see, we draw on each other's strengths and together form a powerful union. Without a host, *I* float powerless in your world, and without me *you* cannot wield magic.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I welcome your presence spirit.
