Node ID=30 dragon encounter
Text=Oh, now this is quite an unpleasant surprise. Do you smell that stench? That is the scent of the calm before the storm, the lull before the chaos, the brief wafting moment of sweet life before an agonizing *death*. Do you know that you are about to trespass in the lair of Azi Dahaka?
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is this Azi Dahaka?
