Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough out of you. Begone.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye angry
Icon=Exit Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Thank you spirit. We should continue on now.
Go to node ID=5 goodbye after warning
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
