Node ID=30 Azi Dahaka
Text=Not quite the student of mythology, mm? It's probably best that you don't know *too* much about Azi Dahaka, lest you unscrew your courage to the screaming, crying, and fleeing place. Azi Dahaka is a storm demon, a nightmarish scaly monster that enjoys devouring crusaders and do-gooders whole.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
