Node ID=400 tawrich
Text=Tawrich is the Daeva of Hunger, a powerful demon with a ravenous appetite for mortal flesh that is never sated. Throughout history, Tawrich has been bound to conquerors and raiders, seeking to devour the world through war and destruction. 
