Node ID=500 daevas explanation demon
Text=Humans have known the Daevas as long as they've known avarice, lust, hate and all the other selfish impulses that give spirits like me warm tingling sensations. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=500 daevas explanation demon 2
