------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=500 divine explanation demon
Text=Ah, the so-called Divine Ones. Like the Daevas, the Divine Spirits have also been referred to by many names over the course of history. The ancient Persians knew them as the immortal Ahura Spentas, while here the Christians call them Cherubim. In Africa they manifest as the Ombwiri. But I call them meddlers of the worst sort, always interfering with the free will of humanity, pushing impressionable young mortals to take the *moral* path. It's the highest form of hypocrisy, if you ask me, which you did.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What is a Daeva?
Go to node ID=500 daevas explanation demon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've heard enough. Let's continue on.
