Text=<Growls> Thoughts of betrayal, rage, and temptation suffuse these caves. This is the work of a powerful Daeva, Aka Manah, known in your tongue as the Evil Mind. He possesses the power to charm and tempt weak-willed creatures. Guard both your body and mind against this foe.
