Node ID=750 name
Text=Moi? I am the patron saint of discontentment, the demon of little *white* lies, apostasy incarnate. My true ancient name is too difficult for you to pronounce - you can imagine the teasing I endured as demon child. It will suffice for you to know me as Saurva.
Should Have Voiceover=1
